      "text": "1 to 3\n\nFrequency once per round\n\n---\nEffect The apprentice magicians wave wands that shoot out minor bolts of electricity at short range. Each enemy in a 5-foot emanation must attempt a DC 19 basic Reflex save save. The damage dealt depends on the number of actions.\n\n1 1d8 electricity damage\n\n2 2d8+3 electricity damage\n\n3 2d8+7 electricity damage",
